# PWA App Icon Style

When creating or regenerating PWA icons, use this style:

## Source

`logo/light-bg/chathub-pwa-icon-light-bg-transparent-outside.png` (1024x1024)

## Style

- **Rounded rectangle** with ~22% corner radius
- **Background inside rounded area**: light blue `#cde2fa` (rgb 205,226,250)
- **Corners outside rounded area**: fully transparent
- **No partial transparency** at edges — clean cut between opaque center and transparent corners

