## Python generation snippet

```python
from PIL import Image, ImageDraw

src = Image.open('logo/light-bg/chathub-pwa-icon-light-bg-transparent-outside.png').convert('RGBA')
BG_COLOR = (205, 226, 250, 255)

# Composite onto light blue background
bg = Image.new('RGBA', src.size, BG_COLOR)
flat = Image.alpha_composite(bg, src)

sizes = {
    'public/icons/icon-192x192.png': (192, 42),
    'public/icons/icon-192x192.maskable.png': (192, 42),
    'public/icons/icon-512x512.png': (512, 110),
    'public/icons/icon-512x512.maskable.png': (512, 110),
    'public/apple-touch-icon.png': (180, 40),
}

for path, (size, radius) in sizes.items():
    resized = flat.resize((size, size), Image.LANCZOS)
    mask = Image.new('L', (size, size), 0)
    draw = ImageDraw.Draw(mask)
    draw.rounded_rectangle([(0, 0), (size - 1, size - 1)], radius=radius, fill=255)
    final = Image.new('RGBA', (size, size), (0, 0, 0, 0))
    final.paste(resized, (0, 0), mask)
    final.save(path, 'PNG')

# Favicons - same approach, save as ICO
```

## Manifest

- `src/server/manifest.ts`: `background_color` and `theme_color` set to `#cde2fa`
- `getImage` must use the actual icon `url` parameter, NOT override with `BRANDING_LOGO_URL`
